{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09435","headline":"西涧种柳 · 韦应物","name":"西涧种柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宰邑乖所愿，僶俛愧昔人。\n聊将休暇日，种柳西涧滨。\n置锸息微倦，临流睇归云。\n封壤自人力，生条在阳春。\n成阴岂自取，爲茂属佗辰。\n延咏留佳赏，山水变夕曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}